{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-karl-0001-pay0-collection",
    "name": "KarloPay API (conexión directa)",
    "description": "Prueba login y create-or-update contra KarloPay **desarrollo o producción** (cambia `karlopay_base` y credenciales) sin pasar por Agora.\n\n1. `karlopay_base`: ej. producción `https://backend-production.karlopay.com` o staging `https://backend-staging.karlopay.com`.\n2. Edita `karlopay_email` y `karlopay_password`.\n3. Ejecuta **Login** → guarda `karlopay_token`.\n4. **Create or update order**: la URL puede venir en raíz (`urlPayment`) o dentro de `outPut` / `data` (el backend soporta ambos en dev y prod).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "karlopay_base",
      "value": "https://backend-production.karlopay.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "karlopay_email",
      "value": "toyota.satelite.agora@karlo.io"
    },
    {
      "key": "karlopay_password",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "karlopay_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "last_urlPayment",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "businessArea",
      "value": "pedidos agora"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth — Login",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{karlopay_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{karlopay_password}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{karlopay_base}}/api/auth/login",
        "description": "Misma petición que usa el backend (`email` + `password`). El token esperado suele estar en `session.access_token`."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 2xx', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200, 299); });",
              "try {",
              "  const json = pm.response.json();",
              "  const t =",
              "    json.session?.access_token ||",
              "    json.token ||",
              "    json.access_token ||",
              "    json.accessToken ||",
              "    (json.data && (json.data.token || json.data.access_token));",
              "  if (t) {",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('karlopay_token', t);",
              "    console.log('Token guardado en variable de colección karlopay_token (longitud ' + t.length + ')');",
              "  } else {",
              "    console.warn('No se encontró token. Cuerpo:', JSON.stringify(json).substring(0, 2000));",
              "  }",
              "} catch (e) {",
              "  console.error('Respuesta no JSON:', pm.response.text().substring(0, 500));",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Orders — Create or update",
      "request": {
        "auth": {
          "type": "bearer",
          "bearer": [
            {
              "key": "token",
              "value": "{{karlopay_token}}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"businessArea\": \"{{businessArea}}\",\n  \"numberOfOrder\": \"POSTMAN_{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"status\": \"R\",\n  \"total\": 11.6,\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"foreignId\": \"postman-test-user\",\n    \"fullName\": \"Prueba Postman\",\n    \"phoneNumber\": \"5555555555\",\n    \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n    \"invoiceProfile\": null\n  },\n  \"operations\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Prueba desde Postman\",\n      \"quantity\": 1,\n      \"price\": 11.6\n    }\n  ],\n  \"product\": null,\n  \"redirectUrl\": \"https://example.com/karlopay-redirect?session_id=POSTMAN_{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"additional\": {\n    \"session_id\": \"POSTMAN_{{$timestamp}}\"\n  }\n}"
        },
        "url": "{{karlopay_base}}/api/orders/create-or-update",
        "description": "Requiere ejecutar antes **1. Auth — Login**. Revisa en la respuesta `urlPayment` (o anidamientos) para la pasarela."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status 2xx', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200, 299); });",
              "try {",
              "  const json = pm.response.json();",
              "  const pick = (o) =>",
              "    o && (o.urlPayment || o.url_payment || o.paymentUrl || o.payment_url);",
              "  let url = pick(json);",
              "  if (!url && json.outPut) url = pick(json.outPut);",
              "  if (!url && json.output) url = pick(json.output);",
              "  if (!url && json.data) url = pick(json.data);",
              "  if (!url && json.order) url = pick(json.order);",
              "  if (!url && json.result) url = pick(json.result);",
              "  if (url) {",
              "    console.log('URL de pago detectada:', url);",
              "    pm.collectionVariables.set('last_urlPayment', url);",
              "  } else {",
              "    console.warn('Sin urlPayment en raíz conocida. Claves nivel raíz:', Object.keys(json));",
              "  }",
              "} catch (e) {",
              "  console.error(e);",
              "}"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
